  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa - Strategic Sector Cooperation on Water - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strategic Sector Cooperation on water  aims at improving the framework conditions of the South African water sector in general and improving the investment planning and implementation capacity at the water service provision level by: 

- Improving Ground Water Utilization  
- Increasing Industrial Water Efficiency
- Improving national regulatory frameworks and the implementation capacity at municipal level for urban water management.
- Providing advisory support to authorities and mandated bodies on industry water &#x2013; energy nexus, incl. infrastructure investment planning, project design, contracting modalities, financing and procurement</narrative>
  </description>
